				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Gratissimum donum misisti,<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Wohl die griechisch-lateinische Ausgabe der Schrift "De providentia sermones X" von <persName ref="p18346">Theodoret</persName>; vgl. <ref target="file12444">Nr. 2397</ref>,1f.</note> signum candidi erga me animi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Rependam data occasione.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Libros nullos remittere nunc temporis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>possum; pauci enim absoluti sunt, et<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">et <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> tabellio<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Unbekannt.</note> properat.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Novi <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nihil habeo, quod te lateat.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18538">Caesar</persName> <placeName ref="l471">Spirę</placeName> fuit<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName> hatte sich vom 24. bis zum 30. März 1546 in <placeName ref="l471">Speyer</placeName> aufgehalten; s. <bibl source="b610">Stälin</bibl> 579.</note> ac contendit <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><placeName ref="l410">Ratisbonam</placeName> impediturus comitia protestantium<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Der Kaiser traf am 10. April 1546 in <placeName ref="l410">Regensburg</placeName> ein; s. <ref target="file12378">Nr. 2331</ref>, Anm. 3.</note>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quidam<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Unbekannt.</note> ex aula <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><persName ref="p18935">principis von Zweyprück</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Graf <persName ref="p18935">Wolfgang von Pfalz-Zweibrücken</persName>.</note> ita scripsit:</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Der keyser hat valediciert<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Lebewohl gesagt.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>den <placeName ref="l20">niderlendischen</placeName> herren und stetten, dann er wölle in 3 monat<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>en in <placeName ref="l875">Hispanien</placeName> sein,<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName> begab sich erst 1556 nach <placeName ref="l875">Spanien</placeName>; vgl. schon <ref target="file12419">Nr. 2372</ref>,10-12.</note> aber in 3 jaren, so im got das leben <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>gebe, welle er widerumb kommen.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">So hoffe er, es werde baß<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="9">besser.</note> im <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>teutscher nation stan.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Hęc ille.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ardentissima febri affligimur<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Siehe schon <ref target="file12441">Nr. 2394</ref>,30f.</note>; <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et robustissimos prostrat et interficit.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Timeo pestem sub<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>secuturam.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Neque solum apud nos hęc calamitas regnat, sed <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>passim in <placeName ref="l632">Alsatia</placeName> et aliis locis fere crudelius aufert, quem<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cunque invaserit.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Aegrotant multi ad 20. diem et demum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>moriuntur.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Dominus mitiget illam pęnam, qua etiam indigi sumus <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ob multiplicia scelera.<pb type="edition" next="289"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p8073">Gilberto</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p8073">Gilbert Cousin</persName>.</note> nostro nihil <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>omnino audio.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Agit negotium <persName ref="p4578">fratris</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Vielleicht <persName ref="p4578">Hugo Cousin d.Ä.</persName>, der Fourier des Kaisers war. Zu ihm s. <hi>AK</hi> X/2 520f.</note> apud d. <persName ref="p7706">Granvilum</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Wohl <persName ref="p7706">Nicolas</persName> und nicht <persName ref="p7705">Antoine de Perrenot, Herr von Granvelle</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>et raro <placeName ref="l356">domi</placeName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><placeName ref="l356">Nozeroy</placeName>.</note> est; sed expecto indies suas literas.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Ultima <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>martii 1546.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis nomine meo d. <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName> et <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName> nostrum<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Nescio, an receperis annotation<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>es in <persName ref="p20984">Haggęum</persName> prophetam<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Jodocus <hi><persName ref="p18099">Willich</persName>,</hi> In <persName ref="p20984">Haggaeum</persName> prophetam doctissima commentaria, <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName>, <persName ref="p3932">Bartholomäus Westheimer</persName>, 1546 (<bibl source="https://gateway-bayern.de/VD16+ZV+1803">VD16 ZV1803</bibl>), mit einer an <persName ref="p1278">Johannes Gast</persName> gerichteten Vorrede. In Zürich ZB ist ein Exemplar vorhanden (Signatur: E 362/2).</note>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Rescribe<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Von</hi> Nescio <hi>bis</hi> Rescribe <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note>.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Corium obvolutum cum libro mittam, quem nuper petiisti,<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Wohl die <persName ref="p18989">Boethius</persName>-Ausgabe; s. dazu <ref target="file12441">Nr. 2394</ref>,1-3.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>paucos post dies, quum incidero in tabellarium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Tuus <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ex animo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>An herren Meyster <persName ref="p495">Heinr<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ychen Bullinger</persName>, luttprie<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>sternn zu <placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>, mynen <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>lieben günstigen herren.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>